**关键问题:PfDetectDestination 如何"识别"正确站台?**

```cpp
inline bool PfDetectDestination(TileIndex tile, Trackdir td)
{
	TrackdirBits tdb = TrackdirToTrackdirBits(td);
	if (!HasReservedTracks(tile, TrackdirBitsToTrackBits(tdb))) return false;
	if (!IsRailStationTile(tile)) return false;
	Train *t = GetTrainForReservation(tile, TrackdirToTrack(td));
	if (t == nullptr) return false;
	if (t->current_order.IsType(OT_WAIT_COUPLE)) {
		if (TrainFitStation(t) && CheckOrderLoad(t) && CheckOrderCargoType(t) && CheckNumberOfWagons(t)) return true;
	}
	return false;
}
```

PfDetectDestination 要求:
1. tile 有 reservation(等待列车的 reservation 覆盖站台)
2. tile 是站台
3. GetTrainForReservation 找到列车
4. 列车 WAIT_COUPLE + 条件匹配

**如果 GetTrainForReservation 找到的列车不是等待列车(或者找不到),PfDetectDestination 返回 false → YAPF 找不到目的地 → FindPath 失败 → couple 寻路 INVALID → 走普通寻路(错误站台)。**

**GetTrainForReservation 的现代实现 vs decouple — 这是关键!**

现代 GetTrainForReservation(tile, track):
```cpp
Train *GetTrainForReservation(TileIndex tile, Track track)
{
	assert_msg_tile(HasReservedTracks(tile, TrackToTrackBits(track)), ...);
	Trackdir trackdir = TrackToTrackdir(track);
	RailTypes rts = GetRailTypeInfo(GetTileRailTypeByTrack(tile, track))->indirect_compatible_railtypes;
	for (int i = 0; i < 2; ++i, trackdir = ReverseTrackdir(trackdir)) {
		if (HasOnewaySignalBlockingTrackdir(tile, ReverseTrackdir(trackdir)) && !HasPbsSignalOnTrackdir(tile, trackdir)) continue;
		FindTrainOnTrackInfo ftoti;
		ftoti.res = FollowReservation(GetTileOwner(tile), rts, tile, trackdir, FRF_IGNORE_ONEWAY, nullptr, nullptr);
		CheckTrainsOnTrack(ftoti, ftoti.res.tile);
