## ✅ 功能实现完成,构建通过(0 错误 0 警告)

### 实现内容

**1. 新增标记**(`src/train.h`):
```cpp
JustDecoupled = 15, ///< Train has just decoupled, reversing is forbidden until it leaves the station.
```

**2. 解挂时设置标记**(`src/train_cmd.cpp` DecoupleTrain):
```cpp
if (!TryTrainDecouple(v, u)) return v;
/* The front part cannot reverse until it has left the station, to avoid crashing into the decoupled part. */
v->flags.Set(VehicleRailFlag::JustDecoupled);
```

**3. 禁止自动掉头**(`CheckReverseTrain`):
```cpp
/* The front has just decoupled, reversing could crash into the decoupled part. */
if (consist->flags.Test(VehicleRailFlag::JustDecoupled)) return false;
```

**4. 禁止手动掉头**(`CmdReverseTrainDirection`):
```cpp
if (v->flags.Test(VehicleRailFlag::JustDecoupled) && !reverse_single_veh) return CMD_ERROR;
```

**5. 驶出站台后清除标记**(`TrainLocoHandler` 每 tick):
```cpp
/* The front has left the station after decoupling, normal reversing is allowed again. */
if (consist->flags.Test(VehicleRailFlag::JustDecoupled) && !IsRailStationTile(consist->tile)) {
	consist->flags.Reset(VehicleRailFlag::JustDecoupled);
}
